   Kretz, Donald R.; Krawczyk, Daniel C., Univ Texas Dallas, Sch Behav \& Brain Sci, Richardson, TX 75083 USA.
   Krawczyk, Daniel C., Univ Texas SW Med Ctr Dallas, Dept Psychiat, Dallas, TX 75390 USA.},
